        "original_id": "7a736475-a59c-5132-8b93-0f376ba82aeb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Francisco Rafael Arellano Félix, Benjamín Arellano Félix, Miguel Ángel Félix Gallardo\n- Organizations: Tijuana Cartel, Arellano-Félix Organization\n- Roles: drug lord, drug trafficker, former leader\n\nFacts:\n- Miguel Ángel Félix Gallardo was one of Mexico’s most prominent drug czars during the 1980s.\n- Francisco Rafael Arellano Félix joined the Tijuana Cartel in 1989 through his brother Benjamín Arellano Félix after the arrest of Miguel Ángel Félix Gallardo.\n- Francisco Rafael Arellano Félix headed the Tijuana Cartel with his brothers early in the 1990s.\n- Francisco Rafael Arellano Félix was born on 24 October 1949 and died on 18 October 2013.\n- Francisco Rafael Arellano Félix was a Mexican drug lord, a former leader of the Tijuana Cartel, and the oldest of seven brothers.\n- Benjamín Arellano Félix was born on 12 March 1952 and is a Mexican drug trafficker and former leader of the Tijuana Cartel, also known as the Arellano-Félix Organization.",
